{
  "id": "the-simpsons---4x03---homer-the-hereticen",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 4x03 - Homer the Heretic.en",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 4x03 - Homer the Heretic.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-08-31T04:14:29.492Z",
  "lineCount": 296,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[Chorus] ## TheSimpsons ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 4300,
      "endMs": 7599
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[Bell Ringing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 18381,
      "endMs": 20281
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "[Whistle Blowing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 25154,
      "endMs": 28214
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 30693,
      "endMs": 32593
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "## [Jazzy Solo ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38334,
      "endMs": 40234
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 60323,
      "endMs": 62223
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 62325,
      "endMs": 64225
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65595,
      "endMs": 67529
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 82411,
      "endMs": 83969
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "[ Thinking ] Ah, another beautiful day in the womb.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84080,
      "endMs": 87709
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "####[Classical] # La, la, la, la, la # # La, la, la # ##La, la, la####",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87817,
      "endMs": 96182
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "[ Gasping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 96292,
      "endMs": 99261
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Let go! Let go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99362,
      "endMs": 101262
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I'm all naked and wet!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 101364,
      "endMs": 103332
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Get up, Homer. It's time for church. I don't wanna go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103432,
      "endMs": 106765
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "It's church. You have to go. Too cold out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106869,
      "endMs": 109633
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I'm tired of having this argument every Sunday. Get dressed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113809,
      "endMs": 117575
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Oh, stupid, itchy church pants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117680,
      "endMs": 120171
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 120283,
      "endMs": 122774
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "One size fits all, my butt!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122885,
      "endMs": 125080
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Come on. We're going to be late. [Pants Tearing] Forget it. I'm not going.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125188,
      "endMs": 130956
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "[ Growls ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 132261,
      "endMs": 134161
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Hey, where's Homer? Your father's... resting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143172,
      "endMs": 146733
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "\"Resting\" hungover, \"resting\" got fired? Help me out here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146842,
      "endMs": 150243
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Ahhh, I'm just a big, toasty cinnamon bun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150346,
      "endMs": 154544
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "I never wanna leave this bed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154650,
      "endMs": 157710
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Uh-oh. Gotta take a whiz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157820,
      "endMs": 160220
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Think, man. Think.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160323,
      "endMs": 162883
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Think, think, think. I better get up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162992,
      "endMs": 166894
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I'm whizzin' with the door open, and I love it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168397,
      "endMs": 172231
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174503,
      "endMs": 177336
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "[ Blubbering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 177807,
      "endMs": 179707
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "[Man] It's 1 1 K-BBL degrees below zero.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179809,
      "endMs": 183711
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I hope you're someplace warm. You bet your sweet... ass!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183813,
      "endMs": 189950
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "I'm afraid our furnace isn't working.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194423,
      "endMs": 196914
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "[Man] Yeah, what's the story?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197026,
      "endMs": 199119
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "But let's just put it out of our minds... and turn to the lamentations of Jeremiah... long version.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199228,
      "endMs": 206691
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "\"Joy is gone from our hearts... our dancing has turned to mourning. '\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206802,
      "endMs": 212203
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "####[Rock And Roll] ####[Girls Singing] ## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217446,
      "endMs": 225482
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "The perfect chance to make my patented, space-age... out-of-this-world moon waffles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228124,
      "endMs": 233795
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Let's see here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233896,
      "endMs": 236228
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Caramels. Waffle batter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236332,
      "endMs": 239426
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Liquid smoke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 239535,
      "endMs": 241560
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Oooh, waffle runoff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243272,
      "endMs": 246139
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Mmm, fattening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255818,
      "endMs": 258810
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "And he was cast into the fiery cauldron of hell!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258921,
      "endMs": 264382
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "The searing heat... the scalding rivers of molten sulfur!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264493,
      "endMs": 269760
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Ahhh, I'm there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269865,
      "endMs": 271924
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Uh-oh. [ Whistling ] Here, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273202,
      "endMs": 277371
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Okay, okay, okay, okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282812,
      "endMs": 285007
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "The service has ended. Go in peace.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285114,
      "endMs": 288106
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "####[Pipe Organ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288217,
      "endMs": 290777
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 290886,
      "endMs": 292854
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "The door's frozen shut, and it's the only way out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292955,
      "endMs": 296356
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "[ Chattering ] Our Father who art in heaven, hallowed be-- Lisa, this is neither the time nor the place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296459,
      "endMs": 301925
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "[Man On Radio] That was Johnny Calhoun with...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302031,
      "endMs": 303999
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "\"Gonna Find Mea Genie With a Magic Bikini. '\" [Man #2]Johnny's next record was a spoken word album of his right-wing political views.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304100,
      "endMs": 309765
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "It killed his career. If you can tell me the name Of that album, call our contest line now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309872,
      "endMs": 313899
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] I know that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314009,
      "endMs": 316102
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "[ Line Ringing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 319582,
      "endMs": 321482
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Hello. This is Homer Simpson. [ Man ] Homer, can you name that title?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 321584,
      "endMs": 325281
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "\"This Things I Believe.\" [ Man #2 ] Uh, can we accept that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325388,
      "endMs": 329791
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "[ Cash Register Ringing ] Whoo-hoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329892,
      "endMs": 331917
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "How's that door coming, Willy? Miracles are your department, Reverend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334697,
      "endMs": 338633
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Uh, while we're waiting, Why don't I read from the Sunday bulletin?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338734,
      "endMs": 342932
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Card table for sale. Top badly damaged. Leg missing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343038,
      "endMs": 345973
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Otherwise fine. One dollar or best offer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346075,
      "endMs": 349567
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "[ Woman On TV] You must be the three chiropractors I sent for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349678,
      "endMs": 352875
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Now, start manipulating my spine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352982,
      "endMs": 355280
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "[Curly]Hey, Moe, we don't know nothin' about manipulatin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355384,
      "endMs": 357579
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "[Moe] You heard the lady. Grab her spine and get crackin. - [Punch Landing]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357686,
      "endMs": 360484
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "[ Chuckling ] Moe is their leader. [Curly Whooping] -[Moe] Why, you! -[Punch Landing] -[Curly]Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360589,
      "endMs": 365059
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "[ Grunting ] Huzzah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 366896,
      "endMs": 369057
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Plea-Please, Christians, don't push.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370933,
      "endMs": 373561
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Excuse me. Pardon me. Whoop. Coming through. Howya doing? Love that hat, baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373669,
      "endMs": 377264
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Come on, TV. Give me some of that sweet, sweet pap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377373,
      "endMs": 381241
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Well, let's define our terms, gentlemen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381343,
      "endMs": 383573
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Are we talking about redistricting or are we talking about reapportionment?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383679,
      "endMs": 387046
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Oh, well, can't win 'em all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387149,
      "endMs": 389379
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "[ Man ] We interrupt this public affairs program to bring you a football game.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389485,
      "endMs": 393421
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Yes! [ Whistle Blowing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393522,
      "endMs": 395422
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "[ Engine Not Turning Over] [Marge Imitating Engine]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397259,
      "endMs": 399784
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "[ Imitating Engine ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 401497,
      "endMs": 404295
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Give it a little more gas. [Pedal Banging] No, no, that's too much. You know what I think would help?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404400,
      "endMs": 409663
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "What? What would help? Nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409772,
      "endMs": 412832
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Oh, doctor. A 98-yard triple reverse... ties the score at 63-63.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412942,
      "endMs": 418880
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "We have seen nothing but razzle-dazzle here today... three visits from Morganna the Kissing Bandit... and the astonishing return of Jim Brown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418981,
      "endMs": 425687
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 425788,
      "endMs": 427688
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Is that what I think it is?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427790,
      "endMs": 430588
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Mm-hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434163,
      "endMs": 436597
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I found... a penny!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436699,
      "endMs": 439862
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Could this be the best day of my life?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439969,
      "endMs": 443234
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 445841,
      "endMs": 447741
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Looks like we have a new champion.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450079,
      "endMs": 451979
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Ah, my beloved family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453816,
      "endMs": 455841
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "How was church? [ Muttering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455951,
      "endMs": 458613
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "[ Snorting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 458721,
      "endMs": 460450
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I, on the other hand, have been having the best day of my life... and I owe it all to skipping church.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460556,
      "endMs": 465859
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "That's a terrible thing to say! Kids, your father doesn't really mean that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465961,
      "endMs": 469761
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Like fun I don't. Marge, I'm never going to church again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469665,
      "endMs": 474159
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Homer, are you actually giving up your faith?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474270,
      "endMs": 477671
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "No. No, no, no, no, no, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477773,
      "endMs": 480799
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Well, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480910,
      "endMs": 482741
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I can't believe you're giving up church, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486482,
      "endMs": 489747
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Hey, what's the big deal about going to some building every Sunday?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489852,
      "endMs": 493379
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "I mean, isn't God everywhere? Amen, brother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493489,
      "endMs": 496049
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "And don't you think that the Almighty has better things to worry about... than where one little guy spends one measly hour of his week?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496158,
      "endMs": 502193
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Tell it, Daddy. And what if we pick the wrong religion?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 502298,
      "endMs": 505358
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Every week we're just making God madder and madder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505468,
      "endMs": 507993
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Testify!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508104,
      "endMs": 510572
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "[ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 510673,
      "endMs": 512538
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Lord, my husband is by no means perfect... but he's a kind, decent man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 512641,
      "endMs": 517805
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Please show him the error of his ways.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517913,
      "endMs": 519972
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Marge, come to bed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520082,
      "endMs": 521982
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "No, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522084,
      "endMs": 523984
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "He doesn't mean to be sacrilegious, Lord.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524086,
      "endMs": 526680
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He just likes to sleep in on Sundays.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526789,
      "endMs": 529417
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Marge. Come to bed, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529525,
      "endMs": 532961
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "[ Whispering ] Lord, please. He's not a bad person, Lord, really.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534797,
      "endMs": 538096
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "It's good for what ails ya. He doesn't mean any harm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538200,
      "endMs": 542261
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "I can wait all--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542371,
      "endMs": 544601
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "[ Snoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 544707,
      "endMs": 546937
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "[Rumbling]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 552214,
      "endMs": 554114
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "[ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 554216,
      "endMs": 556616
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "[ Static Humming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 556719,
      "endMs": 559119
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "[ Gulps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 564226,
      "endMs": 566160
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "God?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566262,
      "endMs": 568423
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Thou has forsaken my church!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568531,
      "endMs": 572092
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Well, kind of, but-- But what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 572201,
      "endMs": 575534
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "I'm not a bad guy. I work hard and I love my kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575638,
      "endMs": 580132
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "So why should I spend half my Sunday hearing about how I'm going to hell?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580242,
      "endMs": 583837
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Hmm, you've got a point there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585047,
      "endMs": 587709
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "You know, sometimes... even I'd rather be watching football.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 587817,
      "endMs": 592948
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Does St. Louis still have a team?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 593055,
      "endMs": 594955
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "No, they moved to Phoenix. Oh, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595057,
      "endMs": 597116
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "You know what I really hate about church? Those boring sermons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 597226,
      "endMs": 601458
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Oh, I couldn't agree more.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601564,
      "endMs": 604226
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "That Reverend Lovejoy really displeases me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 604333,
      "endMs": 606961
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "I think I'll give him a canker sore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607069,
      "endMs": 609594
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Give him one for me. I will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609705,
      "endMs": 612230
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "So I figure I should just try to live right-- [ Purring ] and worship you in my own way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612341,
      "endMs": 617404
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Homer, it's a deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617513,
      "endMs": 619572
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, I have to appear on a tortilla in Mexico.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619682,
      "endMs": 623448
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Dad, can I ask you a question? Sure, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633395,
      "endMs": 635556
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Why are you dedicating your life to blasphemy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635664,
      "endMs": 638155
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Don't worry, sweetheart. If I'm wrong, I'll recant on my deathbed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638267,
      "endMs": 642135
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Hello, my animal friends. Peace be with you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644440,
      "endMs": 648069
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Guys, please, could you give me five minutes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649778,
      "endMs": 652144
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Reverend Lovejoy, I had a bit Of an ulterior motive in inviting you to dinner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 652248,
      "endMs": 656810
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "[ Shouts ] What? No, it's nothing bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656919,
      "endMs": 659547
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I'm just concerned because my husband hasn't been attending your services lately.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659655,
      "endMs": 663682
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Well, I wasn't sure I was doing the right thing... but then God himself told me I should seek a new path.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663792,
      "endMs": 669195
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Oh, really? Yeah. He appeared before me in a dream... and I knew that was special because I usually dream about naked... Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 669298,
      "endMs": 677029
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "[ Groans ] So, Homer, you saw the big cheese?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677139,
      "endMs": 680438
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "What'd he look like? Perfect teeth, nice smell, a class act all the way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680543,
      "endMs": 685003
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Homer, you're crazy! Tell him this is all crazy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685114,
      "endMs": 689175
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Homer, I'd like you to remember Matthew 7:26.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689285,
      "endMs": 692516
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "The foolish man who built his house on sand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692621,
      "endMs": 695954
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "And you remember...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696058,
      "endMs": 698686
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Matthew 21 :1 7.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 698794,
      "endMs": 702252
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "\"And he left them and went out of the city into Bethany and he lodged there\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702364,
      "endMs": 706926
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Yeah. Think about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 708270,
      "endMs": 710602
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Hello, work? This is Homer Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 710706,
      "endMs": 713106
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "I won't be coming in tomorrow. Religious holiday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713208,
      "endMs": 716439
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "The, uh, Feast of Maximum Occupancy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716545,
      "endMs": 720037
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Pretty slick. You should join my religion, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 720149,
      "endMs": 723607
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "It's great. No hell, no kneeling-- Sorry, Homer. I was born a snake handler, and I'll die a snake handler.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 723719,
      "endMs": 730014
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "[Doorbell Rings]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 730125,
      "endMs": 731615
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Neighbor, I heard about your heresy... and we've made it our mission to win you back to the flock.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732895,
      "endMs": 738659
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "No sale. Homer, Christian life isn't all praying and sacrifice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738767,
      "endMs": 742794
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Hey, dig this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742905,
      "endMs": 744805
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "## [ Singing Religious Song ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744907,
      "endMs": 749173
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "[ Snoring ] [Phone Ringing] ## [ Flanders Family Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 749278,
      "endMs": 756174
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760322,
      "endMs": 764122
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Leave me alone. Dad, the heathen's getting away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764226,
      "endMs": 767889
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "I see him, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767997,
      "endMs": 770090
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "[ Crossing Bells Dinging ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 773102,
      "endMs": 774899
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "[ Horn Blaring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 776472,
      "endMs": 779100
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "[ Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 793389,
      "endMs": 795380
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 797393,
      "endMs": 800692
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Where we going? Garbage Island.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800796,
      "endMs": 802855
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "[ Horn Blaring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 802965,
      "endMs": 805229
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 829358,
      "endMs": 831258
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 832728,
      "endMs": 835629
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "[ Cheering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 840002,
      "endMs": 841902
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Let's go, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843238,
      "endMs": 845138
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "How come we have to go to church and Dad gets to stay home and watch cartoons?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845240,
      "endMs": 848641
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "[ Groans ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 848744,
      "endMs": 850735
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "I have a responsibility to raise these children right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850846,
      "endMs": 854247
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "And unless you change, I'll have to tell them their father is... well, wicked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854349,
      "endMs": 860149
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Kids, let me tell you about another so-called \"wicked\" guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860255,
      "endMs": 863088
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "He had long hair and some wild ideas... and he didn't always do what other people thought was right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863192,
      "endMs": 869756
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "And that man's name was--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 869865,
      "endMs": 872425
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "I forget. But the point is-- I forget that too. Marge, you know who I'm talking about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873969,
      "endMs": 880406
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "He used to drive that blue car. Kids, could you wait outside for us?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 880509,
      "endMs": 883967
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Homer, please don't make me choose between my man and my god... because you just can't win.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885681,
      "endMs": 890684
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "There you go again. Always taking someone else's side-- Flanders, the water department, God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890786,
      "endMs": 898148
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "I'm only going to ask you one last time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898260,
      "endMs": 901923
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Are you sure you won't come with us to church?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902030,
      "endMs": 904123
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "[ Man On TV] Coming up next: make your own ladder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904233,
      "endMs": 906463
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Very sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906568,
      "endMs": 908798
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "My friends, the devil walks among us!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911640,
      "endMs": 915041
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "[ Chattering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 915144,
      "endMs": 917544
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "I got him! No, don't look for the pitchfork and pointy tail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917646,
      "endMs": 920945
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Today's devil has assumed a more seductive form... pleasing to the eye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921049,
      "endMs": 925919
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Oooh, a interview with Lorne Michaels.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927156,
      "endMs": 930353
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Oooh. Wait. That's no good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930459,
      "endMs": 933019
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Hey, now we're talking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933128,
      "endMs": 935221
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "\"Our unabashed dictionary defines I.U.D. as...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935330,
      "endMs": 938663
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "\"love springs internal.\"'",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938767,
      "endMs": 940894
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "I don't get it. [Doorbell Chimes] Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942604,
      "endMs": 946335
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "I'm collecting for the Brotherhood of Jewish Clowns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 946441,
      "endMs": 949899
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Last year, tornadoes claimed the lives of75Jewish clowns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950012,
      "endMs": 954278
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "The worst incident was during our convention in Lubbock, Texas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954383,
      "endMs": 958080
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "There were floppy shoes and rainbow wigs everywhere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958187,
      "endMs": 961884
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "It was terrible. [ Sobbing ] Wait a minute. Is this a religious thing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961990,
      "endMs": 967521
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "A religious clown thing, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967629,
      "endMs": 969597
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Sorry. Well, bless you any-- Remember the Sabbath day, to keep it holy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969698,
      "endMs": 975191
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Apu, I see you're not in church.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976872,
      "endMs": 979033
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Oh, but I am. I have a shrine to Ganesha... the god of worldly wisdom located in the employee lounge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979141,
      "endMs": 984609
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Hey, Ganesha, want a peanut? Please do not offer my god a peanut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984713,
      "endMs": 988410
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "No offense, Apu, but when they were handing out religions... you must've been out taking a whiz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988517,
      "endMs": 992753
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Mr. Simpson, please pay for your purchases and get out and come again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992855,
      "endMs": 996552
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Pride goeth before destruction!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996658,
      "endMs": 999786
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Boy, everyone is stupid except me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999895,
      "endMs": 1004764
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "[Snoring]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1006068,
      "endMs": 1007968
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Marge, turn down the heat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1023852,
      "endMs": 1026377
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "That's better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026488,
      "endMs": 1028388
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "[ Snoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1032194,
      "endMs": 1034094
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "[ Sniffing, Whines ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1037032,
      "endMs": 1039057
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "[ Growling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1040469,
      "endMs": 1043438
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "[ Screams ] Fire! What do I do? What do I do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050078,
      "endMs": 1052911
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "[ Coughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1053015,
      "endMs": 1054983
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Oh, the song, the song.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055083,
      "endMs": 1056846
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056952,
      "endMs": 1060513
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Coughing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065394,
      "endMs": 1067862
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "[Apu Gasps] Fire at the old Simpson place!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069531,
      "endMs": 1072329
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "You're on your honor not to steal anything. Oh, we won't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075537,
      "endMs": 1079530
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Little Jamshed, the store is in your hands.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081443,
      "endMs": 1084776
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "How I have waited for this day. [ Cocks Shotgun ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084880,
      "endMs": 1087940
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "[ Siren Wailing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1090085,
      "endMs": 1092144
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "[ Quacking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1097426,
      "endMs": 1100418
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "You ducks are really trying my patience!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1102931,
      "endMs": 1105832
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "But you're so cute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105934,
      "endMs": 1107834
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Homer. Homer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109271,
      "endMs": 1111831
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1119915,
      "endMs": 1123146
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "[ Homer Moans ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1126488,
      "endMs": 1128353
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Dear Lord, may your loving hand guide Homer to the mattress, square and true.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134663,
      "endMs": 1139066
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144272,
      "endMs": 1146399
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "[Siren Wailing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1152347,
      "endMs": 1154406
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "[ Coughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1154516,
      "endMs": 1156916
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Flanders, you saved me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157019,
      "endMs": 1159715
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159821,
      "endMs": 1161618
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Heck, you'd have done the same for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161723,
      "endMs": 1164715
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Help! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164826,
      "endMs": 1167420
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1167529,
      "endMs": 1169588
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "That's right, old friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169698,
      "endMs": 1171928
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "[ Bart, Lisa ] Dad! Oh, Homie, are you all right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172034,
      "endMs": 1174730
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Our magazines and roach traps, gone. All gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174836,
      "endMs": 1179899
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "[ Cat Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1180008,
      "endMs": 1182203
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "I saved your cat. Ow! That hurt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182310,
      "endMs": 1187179
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Hey, what are these axes for?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188283,
      "endMs": 1190751
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "I don't know. Chopping stuff. Gotcha.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190852,
      "endMs": 1193912
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Uh, that's some nice chopping.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196324,
      "endMs": 1198224
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Truly, this was an act of God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1198326,
      "endMs": 1201352
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Hey, wait a minute. Flanders is a regular Charlie Church... and God didn't save his house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1203565,
      "endMs": 1208899
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "D'oh! Any valuables in the house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1211306,
      "endMs": 1214867
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Well, the Picasso, my collection of classic cars-- Sorry. This policy only covers actual losses, not made-up stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214976,
      "endMs": 1223012
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Well, that's just great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1223118,
      "endMs": 1224847
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Fire, man's oldest foe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1224953,
      "endMs": 1227615
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Insatiable, remorseless, unquenchable.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1227722,
      "endMs": 1230418
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Hey, it's out. [ Cheering ] Coming up next, which work better-- springy clothespins or the other kind?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1230525,
      "endMs": 1238226
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "You know, I have a feeling there's a lesson here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1242537,
      "endMs": 1245529
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Yes, the lesson is-- No, don't tell me. I'll get it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1245640,
      "endMs": 1249201
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Oh, I know. The Lord is vengeful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1249311,
      "endMs": 1253042
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "O Spiteful One, show me who to smite, and they shall be \"smoten.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1253148,
      "endMs": 1257517
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Homer, God didn't Set your house on fire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1257619,
      "endMs": 1260110
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "No, but he was working in the hearts Of your friends and neighbors... when they went to your aid... be they Christian, Jew or... miscellaneous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260222,
      "endMs": 1269355
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Hindu. There are 700 million of us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1269464,
      "endMs": 1271728
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Aw, that's super. I was rude to every one of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1271833,
      "endMs": 1274996
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "And you saved my life when you could have just left me to fry... like the proverbial pancake that I am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1275103,
      "endMs": 1281567
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Oh, Homey, I'm so glad to hear you say that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1281676,
      "endMs": 1285009
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Now, would you give church another try?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1285113,
      "endMs": 1288082
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "I'll be there next Sunday, front row, center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1288183,
      "endMs": 1291641
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "[ Snoring Loudly]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1291820,
      "endMs": 1294653
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "####[Harp] Don't feel bad, Homer. Nine out often religions fail in their first year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1296825,
      "endMs": 1305128
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "That's game, Hendrix!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1306735,
      "endMs": 1308999
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "God, I gotta ask you something. What's the meaning of life?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1309104,
      "endMs": 1313040
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "Homer, I can't tell you that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1313141,
      "endMs": 1315336
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Come on. You'll find out when you die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1315443,
      "endMs": 1319379
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "I can't wait that long. You can't wait six months?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1319481,
      "endMs": 1322814
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "No, tell me now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1322918,
      "endMs": 1324977
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "Well, okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1325086,
      "endMs": 1327088
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "text": "Well, okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1327088,
      "endMs": 1327417
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "text": "The meaning of life is--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1327522,
      "endMs": 1330082
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "text": "[ People Chattering ] Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1372167,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ]
}
